# The keyboard's GIF panel (Soma 108+). Bugs Boss found 2026-10-22: the handle jittered while pulled; Done emptied
# the search; the handle was gone after a search. Coordinates are for the Fold profile's cover screen, portrait;
# calibrated on the first emulator run.
ime dev.omalauncher.boss/dev.omalauncher.keyboard.OmaKeyboardService
launch com.android.settings/.Settings
tap Search settings
wait 800
shot keyboard-up
# The GIF button: the bottom strip, after the split switch.
tap 0.16 0.965
wait 1200
shot gif-panel
# The handle, pulled up slowly: the panel grows once and stays (no flicker back and forth).
swipe 0.5 0.585 0.5 0.35 900
wait 600
shot expanded-after-pull
swipe 0.5 0.06 0.5 0.4 900
wait 600
shot collapsed-after-pull
# Search, then Done: the words stay in the field and the handle is there.
tap 0.4 0.62
type cat
wait 1500
shot searching-with-band-handle
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot results-keep-cat-and-handle
# The band's handle pulled up opens the results full screen.
tap 0.4 0.62
swipe 0.5 0.34 0.5 0.1 600
wait 800
shot band-handle-pulled-full-screen
[phone] On the cover screen and unfolded: drag the GIF handle up and down slowly; it moves once per pull, no flicker.
[phone] Search a word, tap Done: the word stays in the field, the handle shows; ✕ beside the arrow goes back to Trending.
[phone] Tap a GIF in a real chat app: it lands in the message box.
